{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>人稱「King Sir」的戲劇大師鍾景輝，今早於家中在睡夢中安詳離世，享年89歲。其姪兒指伯父一生奉獻戲劇，桃李滿門，感謝各位一直以來對他的關心與陪伴。現在家屬正著手處理伯父的身後事，後續會公布喪禮及追思安排。</p><figure><img alt=\"人稱「King Sir」的戲劇大師鍾景輝，今早於家中在睡夢中安詳離世，享年89歲。（電視截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201001/388307975426674688.jpeg/z0TgxZOzSactZSabRMneKaybpr9dFy51CU2-GAlNvhg\"/><figcaption>人稱「King Sir」的戲劇大師鍾景輝，今早於家中在睡夢中安詳離世，享年89歲。（電視截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝一生奉獻戲劇，桃李滿門。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3455445/org/6db8dcbe4dbcffa48610813750e74287.jpg/ZvEVaiHMXgH_wfs4Z2fkONOmQwKYzTWjIFM2XyBTNl8\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝一生奉獻戲劇，桃李滿門。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>8年前患大腸癌淡出</p><p>鍾景輝近年深居簡出，自2016年證實患上大腸癌做手術後，鍾景輝拍完《牛下女高音》便淡出幕前專心休息，有一段長時間未有公開露面。上年前港台DJ夏妙然帶着蛋糕到疑似護老院探望鍾景輝，而藝人余俊峰就帶King Sir去西貢外遊，見King Sir全程坐輪椅，身體狀況似乎出現了大轉變。</p><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝疑入住護老院舍內，裏面有衣櫃，（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852398362726400254916.jpeg/GF4KL_CHAER2QMZHA7Py6kFNo437WyZzo1N4l6NTeJc\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝疑入住護老院舍內，裏面有衣櫃，（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"King Sir都好開心。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852578705477632954832.jpeg/VCENb_PRsB_xsFW8Rrj-GfDypvHGDGVfSMUhCUjFIQk\"/><figcaption>King Sir都好開心。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"全程係床上。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852578701414400064371.jpeg/w25BxAxmwiGj9DbLNuyoAAX1hb0a3tdEfoYIa36GCGs\"/><figcaption>全程係床上。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"聽大家唱生日歌。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852577006784512378426.jpeg/wwR70urqiAjL6gGs8vyY66BKnCJHYCREDdyrew3cq3s\"/><figcaption>聽大家唱生日歌。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852575245045760791280.jpeg/IgOUDPbHKNcXKJ7B-pUIjwpuf_ck6joh1g3UX9YN1F8\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852573235843072093518.jpeg/cvOdIWVHAIGsHibG3IRN6GuqQtnwzKqpnn0wE559MBM\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852582526750720627059.jpeg/4gryTmQRjuNS9vEz0j7AaIi6Hqus3J5iNYfz0jWH89I\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852576381702144968475.jpeg/8m5uGqDqd2HhspF7zbRpWsUTOGVky0Z1qlPmBapT5gU\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852580744040448528901.jpeg/o0l0GixgBk_hMNAOJpCNWuQqV9MxfHNMepsyNnqbMjY\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852573386838016380419.jpeg/8RRRY5BD2fWf1MpbV55F62eTewI8-8jqerd4XXq3eF0\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝88歲生日。（YouTube@Dr Serina Ha.）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鍾景輝明顯瘦咗。（IG@johnsonjunyu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980852916543819776572346.jpeg/45ZTQXsF2QElQzRoaBHJsVEDYevuFtt0p7aurae2rq0\"/><figcaption>鍾景輝明顯瘦咗。（IG@johnsonjunyu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"余俊峰推住King Sir。（IG@johnsonjunyu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250324/980853225160970240345607.jpeg/q_6W40GCY79C8qTzbHHzdSkx7ZqmbOFsu89vhbvPb4U\"/><figcaption>余俊峰推住King Sir。（IG@johnsonjunyu）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T05:38:19.646034+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":722,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}